  nonce: 7afd  # 7afd
  message: "OWNER RULINGS 2026-11-21 (asked with the role table and a before/after of the sketch): (a) Sketch headings: 'Keep today's headings' — HTTP Routes, Controllers, GraphQL and WebSocket Handlers stay; middleware and error handlers get a heading of their own; the registry stores a heading per kind. The merged 'Request Handlers' heading built first is not shipped. (b) Roles of spa_bootstrap, electron_preload, android_activity: 'Accept as proposed' = hosted application; the measured effect (mitmproxy: 22 web-UI exports leave the capped list, 22 Python exports enter; vite: 5 .d.ts exports swapped for 5 node API exports) is accepted. Not asked, reported to the owner: the ninth role 'command' for cli_command, the kind name package_executable for manifest executables, ADR-0063, main_guard counting again for the library-export demotion."  # 7afd
